# .local-utils/ — personal scratch space for this checkout: ad-hoc scripts,
# scratch tokens, DB dumps, experiment output. Nothing in it is ever committed
# and nothing in it is a project guarantee (CI does not read it, reviewers do
# not read it). Deliberate, reviewable tooling belongs in the repo instead —
# see supabase/tests/ for committed verification scripts.
#
# The contents are ignored but the README is tracked, so the convention stays
# discoverable to teammates and agents.
.local-utils/*
!.local-utils/README.md
